|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Basic screen definitions (e.g., title)
!|!
!|10000$-=TITLE=Engineering Demos$
!|!
!|!
!|-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! What RIP file do we call from our demo screens to return here?
!|!
!|10000$-=RETURN=>TELENGIN.RET$
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Labels for each of the six buttons
!|!
!|10000$-=LAB1=Architecture$
!|10000$-=LAB2=Drafting$
!|10000$-=LAB3=Shuttle$
!|10000$-=LAB4=Space$
!|10000$-=LAB5=Weather$
!|10000$-=LAB6=blank$
!|!             
!|! 
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Text variables to execute when one of the six buttons are clicked
!|!
!|10000$-=CMD1=>FOUND.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD2=>SAILBOAT.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD3=>SPACSHUT.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD4=>SHUTTLE.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD5=>TWEATHER.RIP$
!|10000$-=CMD6=NULL$
!|!             
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Where should we go when we click on the "back" button?
!|! 
!|10000$-=BACK=>TELDEMOS.RET$
!|!
!|!
!|!-------------------------------------------------------------------------
!|! Define the status messages displayed when the user hovers over one of
!|! the mouse fields on the screen
!|!
!|10000$=-MSG1=Architectural foundation plans$
!|10000$=-MSG2=Top and side views of the plans for a sailboat$
!|10000$=-MSG3=Top and side views of the space shuttle$
!|10000$=-MSG4=More space shuttle engineering designs$
!|10000$=-MSG5=Weather reporting$
!|10000$=-MSG6=Insert engineering drawing here$
!|!             
!|10000$=-MSG7=Return to the demo menu$
!|!
